# Anchored on purpose. Unanchored, `types/` matches a directory of that name at
# any depth, so it also swallowed `src/types/` — where the app's own types live.
# The tracked files there survived, but any new one was ignored in silence, and
# a missing type only shows up as a broken build on somebody else's machine.
# What this is actually for is the design-sync .d.ts bundle at app/types/.
/types/
